# A stale compiled vite.config.js/.d.ts sitting next to vite.config.ts
# silently wins config resolution over the .ts file (Vite tries .js
# first) and was the exact cause of a hard-to-see bug where edits to
# vite.config.ts were built but never actually applied. Never commit
# these; delete them on sight if `tsc -b`/an IDE ever regenerates them.
/vite.config.js
/vite.config.d.ts
